This project includes code adapted from the following open-source work:

  Project: google-research/spherical-cnn
  URL: https://github.com/google-research/spherical-cnn
  License: Apache License 2.0

Content from layers.py has been adapted to create the following class and methods:
  - swspconv_spatial_spectral,
  - SpinSphericalPlanarConvolution,
  - SphericalPlanarBatchNormalization,
  - MagnitudeNonlinearity3D,
  - SpinSphericalPlanarBatchNormMagnitudeNonlin.

Modifications consists in adding planar convolution support for time-varying spherical signals on the sphere, and
related functionality

